<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Admin Invitation — PeppCruise</title>

    <!--
      Preview text: shown in inbox snippet before the email is opened.
      Hidden visually but read by mail clients.
    -->
    <div style="display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;mso-hide:all;">
      You've been invited to join the PeppCruise Admin Portal. Complete your
      account setup before this link expires.&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌&nbsp;‌
    </div>

    <style>
      :root {
        --pc-bg-dark: #12101c;
        --pc-bg-card: #1c182b;

        --pc-purple: #8247e5;
        --pc-purple-light: #a855f7;
        --pc-purple-soft: #c084fc;

        --pc-purple-deep: #6d28d9;
        --pc-purple-darker: #5b21b6;

        --pc-border: rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.18);

        --pc-shadow: rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.32);
      }

      /* ── Reset ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }

      img {
        display: block;
        max-width: 100%;
        border: 0;
      }

      /* ── Page shell ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      body {
        background-color: #ece9fb;
        font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto,
          Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%;
        color: #1f2937;
        padding: 36px 16px;
      }

      .wrapper {
        width: 100%;
        background-color: #ece9fb;
      }

      /* ── Card container ─────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .container {
        max-width: 600px;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0 auto;
        background: #ffffff;
        border-radius: 20px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow:
          0 24px 80px rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.16),
          0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
      }

      /* ── Header ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .header {
        background: linear-gradient(
          145deg,
          #1c182b 0%,
          #2a1f45 28%,
          #8247e5 68%,
          #a855f7 100%
        );
        padding: 48px 36px 44px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      /* Brand mark circle */
      .brand-mark {
        display: inline-block;
        width: 56px;
        height: 56px;
        line-height: 56px;
        border-radius: 16px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
        border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
        font-size: 22px;
        font-weight: 900;
        color: #ffffff;
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
        letter-spacing: -1px;
      }

      .brand-label {
        font-size: 11px;
        letter-spacing: 2.5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 14px;
      }

      .header h1 {
        color: #ffffff;
        font-size: 30px;
        font-weight: 800;
        line-height: 1.2;
        letter-spacing: -0.4px;
      }

      .header-subtitle {
        margin-top: 12px;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.65;
      }

      /* Decorative pill divider */
      .header-divider {
        margin-top: 28px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        gap: 7px;
      }

      .div-dot {
        width: 5px;
        height: 5px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      }

      .div-dot.large {
        width: 28px;
        height: 5px;
        border-radius: 3px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
      }

      /* ── Body content ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .content {
        padding: 44px 36px 16px;
      }

      .greeting {
        font-size: 20px;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111827;
        margin-bottom: 20px;
      }

      .body-text {
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #4b5563;
        margin-bottom: 16px;
      }

      /* ── Invite detail card ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .invite-card {
        margin: 32px 0;
        border-radius: 16px;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 1px solid rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.16);
      }

      .invite-card-strip {
        padding: 13px 22px;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #1f1830 0%,
          #8247e5 58%,
          #a855f7 100%
        );
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 8px;
      }

      .strip-icon {
        font-size: 16px;
      }

      .strip-label {
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 1.8px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
      }

      .invite-card-body {
        background: linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          #fcfbff 0%,
          #f6f2ff 100%
        );
        padding: 6px 22px 14px;
      }

      .detail-row {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: flex-start;
        gap: 16px;
        padding: 14px 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(82, 40, 220, 0.08);
      }

      .detail-row:last-child {
        border-bottom: none;
        padding-bottom: 0;
      }

      .detail-label {
        color: #6b7280;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 500;
        flex-shrink: 0;
      }

      .detail-value {
        color: #111827;
        font-size: 13.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        text-align: right;
        word-break: break-word;
      }

      /* Inline badges on detail values */
      .badge-role {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 3px 11px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.12);
        color: #6d28d9;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.2px;
      }

      .badge-expiry {
        display: inline-block;
        padding: 3px 11px;
        border-radius: 20px;
        background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1);
        color: #92400e;
        font-size: 12px;
        font-weight: 700;
      }

      /* ── Primary CTA button ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .button-wrapper {
        text-align: center;
        margin: 36px 0 28px;
      }

      .cta-button {
        display: inline-block;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #6d28d9 0%,
          #8247e5 52%,
          #a855f7 100%
        );
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        padding: 16px 40px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 15.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.15px;
        box-shadow: 0 12px 34px rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.32);
      }

      /* ── Fallback link section ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .fallback-section {
        margin-top: 20px;
        border-radius: 14px;
        border: 1px dashed rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.24);
        background-color: #f9f8ff;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .fallback-header-bar {
        padding: 10px 18px;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(82, 40, 220, 0.1);
        font-size: 11px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 1.5px;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        color: #8247e5;
        background: rgba(130, 71, 229, 0.05);
      }

      .fallback-body {
        padding: 16px 18px 18px;
      }

      .fallback-intro {
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #6b7280;
        margin-bottom: 12px;
        line-height: 1.5;
      }

      /* URL + copy row */
      .url-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: stretch;
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .url-masked-wrap {
        flex: 1;
        min-width: 0; /* critical — prevents overflow */
        background: #ffffff;
        border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
        border-radius: 9px;
        padding: 9px 13px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .url-masked-text {
        font-family: "SFMono-Regular", "Fira Code", "Courier New", Courier,
          monospace;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #374151;
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow: hidden;
        text-overflow: ellipsis;
        display: block;
        max-width: 100%;
      }

      .url-copy-btn {
        display: inline-block;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        padding: 9px 16px;
        border-radius: 9px;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #6d28d9 0%,
          #8247e5 60%,
          #a855f7 100%
        );
        color: #ffffff !important;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-size: 12.5px;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0.1px;
        white-space: nowrap;
        box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(82, 40, 220, 0.28);
      }

      .fallback-note {
        margin-top: 11px;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #9ca3af;
        line-height: 1.55;
      }

      /* ── Security notice ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .notice {
        margin-top: 28px;
        padding: 17px 20px;
        border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b;
        background-color: #fffbeb;
        border-radius: 0 10px 10px 0;
      }

      .notice p {
        font-size: 13.5px;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #78350f;
      }

      .closing {
        margin-top: 28px;
        font-size: 15px;
        line-height: 1.8;
        color: #4b5563;
        padding-bottom: 36px;
      }

      /* ── Footer ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .footer {
        border-top: 1px solid #ede9fe;
        background: linear-gradient(
          180deg,
          #f7f4ff 0%,
          #efe8ff 100%
        );
        padding: 28px 36px 36px;
        text-align: center;
      }

      .footer-regards {
        font-size: 14px;
        color: #6b7280;
        margin-bottom: 5px;
      }

      .footer-team {
        font-size: 15px;
        font-weight: 800;
        color: #8247e5;
        margin-bottom: 0;
      }

      .footer-rule {
        width: 36px;
        height: 3px;
        background: linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #8247e5,
          #a855f7
        );
        border-radius: 2px;
        margin: 18px auto 16px;
      }

      .footer-copy {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #9ca3af;
      }

      /* ── Responsive — mobile ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {
        body {
          padding: 16px 8px;
        }

        .container {
          border-radius: 16px;
        }

        .header {
          padding: 36px 22px 32px;
        }

        .header h1 {
          font-size: 24px;
        }

        .content {
          padding: 32px 20px 12px;
        }

        .footer {
          padding: 24px 20px 28px;
        }

        .greeting {
          font-size: 18px;
        }

        .invite-card-body {
          padding: 4px 16px 12px;
        }

        /* Stack detail rows on small screens */
        .detail-row {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 5px;
        }

        .detail-value {
          text-align: left;
        }

        /* Full-width button on mobile */
        .cta-button {
          display: block;
          text-align: center;
          padding: 16px 20px;
          transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .cta-button:hover {
          opacity: 0.96;
        }

        /* Stack URL row vertically */
        .url-row {
          flex-direction: column;
          gap: 10px;
        }

        .url-copy-btn {
          text-align: center;
          padding: 12px 16px;
        }

        /* Ensure masked URL never overflows */
        .url-masked-wrap {
          min-width: 0;
          max-width: 100%;
        }

        .url-masked-text {
          max-width: 100%;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="container">

        <!-- ── Header ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div class="header">
          <div class="brand-mark">PC</div>
          <div class="brand-label">PeppCruise Admin Portal</div>
          <h1>Admin Invitation</h1>
          <p class="header-subtitle">
            You've been invited to join the PeppCruise administrative platform.
          </p>
          {{!-- <div class="header-divider">
            <span class="div-dot"></span>
            <span class="div-dot large"></span>
            <span class="div-dot"></span>
          </div> --}}
        </div>

        <!-- ── Body content ─────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div class="content">

          <p class="greeting">Hello {{firstName}},</p>

          <p class="body-text">
            You've been invited to join the <strong>PeppCruise Admin Portal</strong> as a <strong>{{role}}</strong>. We're glad to have you on the team.
          </p>

          <p class="body-text">
            Click the button below to complete your account setup and create your administrator credentials.
          </p>

          <!-- Invite detail card -->
          <div class="invite-card">
            <div class="invite-card-strip">
              {{!-- <span class="strip-icon">🔐</span> --}}
              <span class="strip-label">Invitation Details</span>
            </div>
            <div class="invite-card-body">
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Admin Role </span>
                <span class="detail-value">
                  <span class="badge-role">{{role}}</span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Email Address </span>
                <span class="detail-value">{{email}}</span>
              </div>
              <div class="detail-row">
                <span class="detail-label">Invitation Expires </span>
                <span class="detail-value">
                  <span class="badge-expiry">3 days from now</span>
                </span>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Primary CTA -->
          <div class="button-wrapper">
            <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="cta-button">Complete Account Setup →</a>
          </div>

          <!-- Fallback link section -->
          <div class="fallback-section">
            <div class="fallback-header-bar">If the button above doesn't work</div>
            <div class="fallback-body">
              <p class="fallback-intro">
                Your invitation contains a secure, one-time link. Use the button below to open it directly in your browser.
              </p>
              <div class="url-row">
                <div class="url-masked-wrap">
                  <span class="url-masked-text">
                    {{appUrl}}/onboarding/admin/accept?token=••••••••••••
                  </span>
                </div>
                <a href="{{inviteUrl}}" class="url-copy-btn">Open Link</a>
              </div>
              <p class="fallback-note">
                To copy the full link, right-click <strong>Open Link</strong> and select <em>"Copy link address"</em> — the token is not displayed here for security.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Security notice -->
          <div class="notice">
            <p>
              <strong>Security notice:</strong> This invitation link is private and expires after 3 days. If you were not expecting this invitation, you can safely ignore this email — no account will be created without your action.
            </p>
          </div>

          <p class="closing">
            We're looking forward to working with you on the PeppCruise platform. If you have any questions, reach out to your administrator.
          </p>

        </div>

        <!-- ── Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
        <div class="footer">
          <p class="footer-regards">Best regards,</p>
          <p class="footer-team">The PeppCruise Team</p>
          <div class="footer-rule"></div>
          <p class="footer-copy">© 2026 PeppCruise. All rights reserved.</p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>